{%- comment -%}
  cm-display-title: SEO display-title override (BACKUP THEME DISPLAY TEST).

  Maps product.handle -> approved customer-facing display title. Products with
  no entry fall back to product.title. This only affects VISIBLE storefront
  text. It must NOT be used for JSON-LD, Open Graph, <title>, feeds, cart data
  or JS/ARIA values that need the real Shopify title.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} Product object (required)
  - raw: {Boolean} true = output UNESCAPED text (only for passing to another snippet
      that escapes it itself, e.g. cm-breadcrumb). Default: escaped.

  Usage:
  {% render 'cm-display-title', product: card_product %}
  Outputs the HTML-escaped title. To get it into a variable:
  {%- capture my_title -%}{% render 'cm-display-title', product: product %}{%- endcapture -%}

  To add / change a title: edit the matching `when` below. Do not edit
  product.title in Shopify admin for this test.
{%- endcomment -%}
